* 100 stage RC Ladder.
*
* Generated by running RC_ladder.pl 100 <return>, where 100 is the number of resistor 
* with shunt capacitor subcircuits in series.
*
* Author: Heidi Thornquist
* Date: 04/15/2008
*
Vs 1 0 PULSE(1 2 25e-9 25n 25n 400n 1m)

.subckt RCBlock IN OUT GND
R1 IN OUT 20
C1 OUT GND 1p
.ends

